ORDER i) The Criminal Petition is allowed;
NC: 2023:KHC:40236 ii) The impugned proceedings in C.C.No.16798/2021 pending on the file of the 37th Additional Chief Metropolitan Magistrate Court, Bengaluru, is hereby quashed.

